<title>USA: IRT Property names President McAuley CEO.</title>
<headline>IRT Property names President McAuley CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IRT Property Co, a real estate investment trust, said on Friday it named President and Chief Operating Officer Thomas McAuley, 51, to the additional post of chief executive officer effective January 1.</p>
<p>McAuley succeeds Donald MacLeod, who would remain chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>McAuley has been with IRT since October 1995 and has served on the board since 1987. Previously, he was a regional partner with Faison and Associates, a Charlotte-based real estate management and development company, IRT said.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
